{{JPExclusive}}
'''Evangelion Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating [[Shin Japan Heroes Universe Collaboration Event#Rescue! Evangelion Cat|Rescue! Evangelion Cat]]. It was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 703
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Evangelion Cat
|name2 = Shin Evangelion Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Shin Evangelion Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Its laughable stats make it unworthy of using in battle. Even as an early game generalist, it doesn't work well at all – it has low damage and health, so it struggles to fend off even the most basic of enemies that aren't [[Doge]] or [[Those Guys]]. Its incredibly infrequent attacks and single target completely prevent it from clearing peons properly. It also has a rather long cooldown and high cost for its low stats. Even against [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]], its stats don't do it any favours. Angels tend to be aggressive, high damage pushers, so this unit can be shredded by even a couple of [[Gabriel]]s, not to mention it has less than a third of [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]]'s base HP, with a longer cooldown and higher cost.

Essentially, this unit's only real use is to boost your user rank. Even Rocker Cat, Ramen's first form, has higher stats.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

